}\\)</span> is defined in\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"81d2de5abb2876b6\" href=\"?note=81d2de5abb2876b6\" title=\"89-df-propositional-tautology\">89-df-propositional-tautology</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"97dd3729fefd2e30\" href=\"?note=97dd3729fefd2e30\" title=\"89-df-k-axiom\">89-df-k-axiom</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic\\text{-}k}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{K}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathcal{T}_{\\Box}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in X\\to\\Box A\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic\\text{-}k}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{K}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathcal{T}_{\\Box}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in X\\to\\Box A\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-k-axiom",